    "detailed_description": "This is a <strong>co-op puzzle</strong> game centered around time control and object manipulation.<br>The abandoned reassembling laboratory is experiencing anomalies, with space and time being distorted. Players will take on the roles of the missing person, <u>Sophia</u>, and the investigator,<u> Thirteen</u>, as they together uncover the secrets of the laboratory.<br><br><strong>Please note that this game requires both a keyboard and a gamepad to play.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2>The game design revolves around &quot;character abilities&quot; and &quot;alterations&quot;. Both players must utilize each other's abilities to cooperate and use objects in the levels to help each other progress. The levels' complexity and enjoyment will increase as the game progresses, allowing players to experience the game design centered around &quot;alterations&quot;.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437910/extras/2f03f1e24f7c7fd1ecaf4c0b83b80462.poster.avif?t=1687131013\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437910/extras/2f03f1e24f7c7fd1ecaf4c0b83b80462.webm?t=1687131013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437910/extras/2f03f1e24f7c7fd1ecaf4c0b83b80462.mp4?t=1687131013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Cooperative level design for two players, using remote multiplayer to invite friends to play together and experience levels and puzzles specifically designed for cooperative play, testing their synergy and cooperation.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437910/extras/186aa16bc89c031eb678dde0f3b69203.poster.avif?t=1687131013\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437910/extras/186aa16bc89c031eb678dde0f3b69203.webm?t=1687131013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437910/extras/186aa16bc89c031eb678dde0f3b69203.mp4?t=1687131013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Abilities</h2>Player 1,<u> Sofia</u>, has the ability to control time and manipulate recorded events, serving as the logical puzzle solver.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437910/extras/db0c4c6d969cd6f0abf647ca46fd3806.poster.avif?t=1687131013\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437910/extras/db0c4c6d969cd6f0abf647ca46fd3806.webm?t=1687131013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437910/extras/db0c4c6d969cd6f0abf647ca46fd3806.mp4?t=1687131013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Player 2, <u>Thirteen</u>, can alter objects using their energy, turning special materials into ghostly states, and even transforming themselves into energy to access unique abilities.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437910/extras/4a8fa1ab2720ed34fdc304b670c5ec1d.poster.avif?t=1687131013\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437910/extras/4a8fa1ab2720ed34fdc304b670c5ec1d.webm?t=1687131013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437910/extras/4a8fa1ab2720ed34fdc304b670c5ec1d.mp4?t=1687131013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "This is a <strong>co-op puzzle</strong> game centered around time control and object manipulation.<br>The abandoned reassembling laboratory is experiencing anomalies, with space and time being distorted. Players will take on the roles of the missing person, <u>Sophia</u>, and the investigator,<u> Thirteen</u>, as they together uncover the secrets of the laboratory.<br><br><strong>Please note that this game requires both a keyboard and a gamepad to play.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2>The game design revolves around &quot;character abilities&quot; and &quot;alterations&quot;. Both players must utilize each other's abilities to cooperate and use objects in the levels to help each other progress. The levels' complexity and enjoyment will increase as the game progresses, allowing players to experience the game design centered around &quot;alterations&quot;.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437910/extras/2f03f1e24f7c7fd1ecaf4c0b83b80462.poster.avif?t=1687131013\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437910/extras/2f03f1e24f7c7fd1ecaf4c0b83b80462.webm?t=1687131013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437910/extras/2f03f1e24f7c7fd1ecaf4c0b83b80462.mp4?t=1687131013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Cooperative level design for two players, using remote multiplayer to invite friends to play together and experience levels and puzzles specifically designed for cooperative play, testing their synergy and cooperation.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437910/extras/186aa16bc89c031eb678dde0f3b69203.poster.avif?t=1687131013\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437910/extras/186aa16bc89c031eb678dde0f3b69203.webm?t=1687131013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437910/extras/186aa16bc89c031eb678dde0f3b69203.mp4?t=1687131013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Abilities</h2>Player 1,<u> Sofia</u>, has the ability to control time and manipulate recorded events, serving as the logical puzzle solver.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437910/extras/db0c4c6d969cd6f0abf647ca46fd3806.poster.avif?t=1687131013\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437910/extras/db0c4c6d969cd6f0abf647ca46fd3806.webm?t=1687131013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437910/extras/db0c4c6d969cd6f0abf647ca46fd3806.mp4?t=1687131013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Player 2, <u>Thirteen</u>, can alter objects using their energy, turning special materials into ghostly states, and even transforming themselves into energy to access unique abilities.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437910/extras/4a8fa1ab2720ed34fdc304b670c5ec1d.poster.avif?t=1687131013\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437910/extras/4a8fa1ab2720ed34fdc304b670c5ec1d.webm?t=1687131013\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2437910/extras/4a8fa1ab2720ed34fdc304b670c5ec1d.mp4?t=1687131013\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
